# Checked in
#   README.md, LAYOUT.md, PINMUX.md, LICENSE, .gitignore
#   zephyr/west.yml                   west manifest (workspace topdir is the repo root)
#   linux-app/                        Linux userspace program (ai64)
#   beagle-linux/                     Debian overlay, patched kernel modules, scripts
#   containers/                       Linux, TI CGT, and Zephyr SDK images
#   zephyr/                           R5F app, shared layout header, eRPC IDL and shim
#   pru/icssg0/                       one folder per ICSSG0 core (not pru/build/)
#   dsp/                              C66x and C7x hello images (not dsp/build/)
#   yocto/                            kas, layers, and config only
#
# Temporary. These stay on disk and stay untracked.

# Notes about your own setup and plans, kept out of git.
local-info/

